  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a nameless valley, after many investigative methods and immortal essence stone expense, Fang Yuan enters by turning into a current with current charge Gu, finds three layers with ancient furniture and drawings, and reaches an early stage Immortal Gu on the third floor. Gu Immortal Shui Ni, creator of Spirit Affinity House, used this Immortal Gu house as a signature method; without a token it can repel rank eight Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        566
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_current_charge_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_shui_ni",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Mo Yao succeeded in refining the early stage of the Immortal Gu, she set up the Immortal Gu house Water Pavilion in this nameless valley. Inside the pavilion she nurtured the Gu to completed form.",
      "chapters": [
        567
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "valley-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan decides to refine part of Water Pavilion before leaving, noting it is now ownerless. Water Pavilion is one of the symbols of Spirit Affinity House, wielded by Fairy Mo Yao back then. Fang Yuan finds no less than three thousand Gu worms in its assembly, with core rank seven Water Harmony Gu and assisting Immortal Gu Worldly Wave Trace and Delight in Water and Mountain. After refining many rank one and rank two mortal Gu, he claims ten percent control authority. Mo Yao’s will asks that Water Pavilion be returned to Spirit Affinity House.",
      "chapters": [
        568
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
